      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://finneytown.org/about/history-of-finneytown/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Finneytown shifted from a rural area to a suburb in the 20th century as automobiles arrived and dirt roads were paved.",
